	                        status,
	                        actualHomeCorners: getValue(previousSelection, 'ActualHomeCorners') ?? null,
	                        actualAwayCorners: getValue(previousSelection, 'ActualAwayCorners') ?? null,
	                        actualTotalCorners: getValue(previousSelection, 'ActualTotalCorners') ?? null
	                    };
	                    const response = await fetch(`${statusEndpointUrl}?id=${encodeURIComponent(id)}`, {
	                        method: 'PUT',
	                        headers: jsonHeaders(),
	                        body: JSON.stringify(payload)
	                    });

	                    if (!response.ok) {
	                        const error = await response.json().catch(() => ({ error: 'No se pudo actualizar el resultado.' }));
	                        throw new Error(error.error ?? 'No se pudo actualizar el resultado.');
	                    }

	                    const updatedSelection = await response.json();
	                    replaceSelection(updatedSelection);
	                    render();
                        loadMonthlyHistory();
	                } catch (error) {
	                    if (error.name === 'AbortError') {
	                        return;
	                    }

	                    render();
	                    setError(error.message);
	                }
	            };

	            const resolveSelection = async id => {
	                if (!canUpdateResults) {
	                    setError('Solo usuarios Admin pueden liquidar resultados.');
	                    return;
	                }

	                const row = tableBody.querySelector(`[data-selection-row="${String(id)}"]`);
	                const input = row?.querySelector(`input[data-actual-result="${String(id)}"]`);
	                const actualValue = Number(input?.value);
	                if (!input || input.value.trim() === '' || !Number.isInteger(actualValue) || actualValue < 0) {
	                    setError(`Ingresa una cantidad real válida de ${marketUnitLabel}: un entero igual o mayor que cero.`);
	                    input?.focus();
	                    return;
	                }

	                setError('');
	                setRowControlsDisabled(id, true);

	                try {
	                    const response = await fetch(`${resolveEndpointUrl}?id=${encodeURIComponent(id)}`, {
	                        method: 'PUT',
	                        headers: jsonHeaders(),
	                        body: JSON.stringify({ actualValue })
	                    });

	                    if (!response.ok) {
	                        const error = await response.json().catch(() => ({ error: 'No se pudo liquidar el pick.' }));
	                        throw new Error(error.error ?? 'No se pudo liquidar el pick.');
	                    }

	                    const updatedSelection = await response.json();
	                    replaceSelection(updatedSelection);
	                    render();
                        loadMonthlyHistory();
	                } catch (error) {
	                    render();
	                    setError(error.message);
	                }
	            };

	            const deleteSelection = async id => {
	                if (!canUpdateResults) {
	                    setError('Solo usuarios Admin pueden eliminar predicciones.');
	                    return;
	                }

	                const selection = selectionsById.get(String(id));
	                if (!selection) {
	                    return;
	                }

	                const matchLabel = `${getHomeTeam(selection)} vs ${getAwayTeam(selection)}`;
	                if (!window.confirm(`¿Eliminar definitivamente la predicción ${matchLabel}? Esta acción no se puede deshacer.`)) {
	                    return;
	                }

	                setError('');
	                setRowControlsDisabled(id, true);

	                try {
	                    const response = await fetch(`${deleteEndpointUrl}?id=${encodeURIComponent(id)}`, {
	                        method: 'DELETE',
                            headers: { 'RequestVerificationToken': antiforgeryToken }
	                    });

	                    if (!response.ok) {
	                        const error = await response.json().catch(() => ({ error: 'No se pudo eliminar la predicción.' }));
	                        throw new Error(error.error ?? 'No se pudo eliminar la predicción.');
	                    }

	                    selections = selections.filter(item =>
	                        String(getValue(item, 'AutomatedCornerBetSelectionId')) !== String(id));
	                    render();
                        loadMonthlyHistory();
	                } catch (error) {
	                    render();
	                    setError(error.message);
	                }
	            };

            const loadSelections = async () => {
                requestController?.abort();
                const currentController = new AbortController();
                requestController = currentController;
                currentPage = 1;
                setError('');
                filteredSelections = [];
                tableSelections = [];
                setLoading(true);
                visibleCount.textContent = 'Cargando...';

                try {
                    const response = await fetch(`${endpointUrl}${buildQuery()}`, {
                        signal: currentController.signal
                    });

                    if (!response.ok) {
                        const error = await response.json().catch(() => ({ error: 'Bot picks could not be loaded.' }));
                        throw new Error(error.error ?? 'Bot picks could not be loaded.');
                    }

                    selections = await response.json();
                    const browserQuery = new URLSearchParams(buildQuery().replace(/^\?/, ''));
                    browserQuery.delete('marketFamily');
                    browserQuery.set('market', marketFamily);
                    window.history.replaceState(null, '', `${window.location.pathname}?${browserQuery.toString()}`);
                    render();
                } catch (error) {
                    if (error.name === 'AbortError') {
                        return;
                    }

                    selections = [];
                    filteredSelections = [];
                    tableSelections = [];
                    summarize(filteredSelections);
                    renderDataScience(filteredSelections);
                    tableWrap.classList.add('d-none');
                    emptyState.classList.add('d-none');
                    pagination.classList.add('d-none');
                    visibleCount.textContent = '0 recomendaciones visibles';
                    setError(error.message);
                } finally {
                    if (requestController === currentController) {
                        setLoading(false);
                    }
                }
            };

            const renderMonthlyHistory = () => {
                const visibleMonths = activeBotTab
                    ? monthlyHistoryItems.filter(month =>
                        String(getValue(month, 'BotKey') ?? '') === activeBotTab)
                    : monthlyHistoryItems;

                monthlyHistoryBody.innerHTML = visibleMonths.map(month => {
                        const monthValue = String(getValue(month, 'Month') ?? '');
                        const monthDate = parseMonthKey(monthValue.slice(0, 7));
                        const monthLabel = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(locale, {
                            year: 'numeric',
                            month: 'long'
                        }).format(monthDate);
                        const profitLoss = number(getValue(month, 'ProfitLoss')) ?? 0;
                        const yieldPct = number(getValue(month, 'YieldPct'));
                        const botKey = String(getValue(month, 'BotKey') ?? 'Legacy');
                        const badgeClass = botKey === 'A'
                            ? 'bot-badge-a'
                            : botKey === 'B'
                                ? 'bot-badge-b'
                                : botKey === 'C'
                                    ? 'bot-badge-c'
                                    : botKey === 'D'
                                        ? 'bot-badge-d'
                                        : botKey === 'E'
                                            ? 'bot-badge-e'
                                            : botKey === 'F'
                                                ? 'bot-badge-f'
                                                : 'bot-badge-legacy';

                        return `
                            <tr>
                                <td>
                                    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-link fw-semibold text-capitalize p-0" type="button" data-history-month="${escapeHtml(monthKeyFromDate(monthDate))}">
                                        ${escapeHtml(monthLabel)}
                                    </button>
                                </td>
                                <td><span class="bot-badge ${badgeClass}">${escapeHtml(getValue(month, 'BotLabel') ?? botKey)}</span></td>
                                <td class="text-end">${escapeHtml(getValue(month, 'Total'))}</td>
                                <td class="text-end">${escapeHtml(getValue(month, 'Won'))} / ${escapeHtml(getValue(month, 'Lost'))} / ${escapeHtml(getValue(month, 'Push'))} / ${escapeHtml(getValue(month, 'Void'))} / ${escapeHtml(getValue(month, 'Pending'))}</td>
                                <td class="text-end">${escapeHtml(formatDecimal(getValue(month, 'SettledStake')))}</td>
                                <td class="text-end ${signedClass(profitLoss)}">${escapeHtml(formatDecimal(profitLoss))}</td>
                                <td class="text-end ${signedClass(yieldPct)}">${yieldPct === null ? '-' : `${escapeHtml(formatCompact(yieldPct))}%`}</td>
                            </tr>
                        `;
                    }).join('');

                monthlyHistoryEmpty.textContent = activeBotTab
                    ? `Aún no hay meses con recomendaciones para ${botTabLabel(activeBotTab)}.`
                    : 'Aún no hay meses con recomendaciones.';
                monthlyHistoryEmpty.classList.toggle('d-none', visibleMonths.length > 0);
                monthlyHistoryWrap.classList.toggle('d-none', visibleMonths.length === 0);
            };

            const loadMonthlyHistory = async () => {
                monthlyHistoryLoading.classList.remove('d-none');
                monthlyHistoryWrap.classList.add('d-none');
                monthlyHistoryEmpty.classList.add('d-none');

                try {
                    const response = await fetch(monthlyHistoryUrl);
                    if (!response.ok) {
                        throw new Error('No se pudo cargar el historial mensual.');
                    }

                    monthlyHistoryItems = await response.json();
                    renderMonthlyHistory();
                } catch (error) {
                    monthlyHistoryItems = [];
                    monthlyHistoryBody.innerHTML = '';
                    monthlyHistoryEmpty.textContent = error instanceof Error
                        ? error.message
                        : 'No se pudo cargar el historial mensual.';
                    monthlyHistoryEmpty.classList.remove('d-none');
                } finally {
                    monthlyHistoryLoading.classList.add('d-none');
                }
            };

            const renderReason = raw => {
                if (!raw) {
                    return '<div class="text-muted">Sin decisionReason.</div>';
                }

                const parsed = parseDecisionReason(raw);
                if (parsed) {
                    return renderJsonValue(parsed);
                }

                return `<details open><summary>Raw decisionReason</summary><pre class="bot-picks-reason-raw">${escapeHtml(raw)}</pre></details>`;
            };

            const renderThresholds = thresholds => {
                const thresholdEntries = [
                    ['MinEdge', thresholds?.MinEdge ?? thresholds?.minEdge],
                    ['MinExpectedValue', thresholds?.MinExpectedValue ?? thresholds?.minExpectedValue],
                    ['MinDistanceToLine', thresholds?.MinDistanceToLine ?? thresholds?.minDistanceToLine],
                    ['MaxContextDifference', thresholds?.MaxContextDifference ?? thresholds?.maxContextDifference],
                    ['MinOddsExclusive', thresholds?.MinOddsExclusive ?? thresholds?.minOddsExclusive],
                    ['StakeMultiplier', thresholds?.StakeMultiplier ?? thresholds?.stakeMultiplier]
                ];

                return `
                    <div class="bot-threshold-grid">
                        ${thresholdEntries.map(([label, value]) => `
                            <div class="bot-threshold-item">
                                <div class="small text-muted">${escapeHtml(label)}</div>
                                <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(formatCompact(value))}</div>
                            </div>
                        `).join('')}
                    </div>
                `;
            };

            const renderJsonValue = value => {
                if (value === null || value === undefined) {
                    return '<span class="text-muted">null</span>';
                }

                if (Array.isArray(value)) {
                    return `<ol class="mb-0">${value.map(item => `<li>${renderJsonValue(item)}</li>`).join('')}</ol>`;
                }

                if (typeof value === 'object') {
                    return `
                        <div class="bot-picks-reason-grid">
                            ${Object.entries(value).map(([key, val]) => `
                                <div class="text-muted small">${escapeHtml(key)}</div>
                                <div>${renderJsonValue(val)}</div>
                            `).join('')}
                        </div>
                    `;
                }

                return escapeHtml(String(value));
            };

            const openDetail = id => {
                const item = selectionsById.get(String(id));
                if (!item) {
                    return;
                }

	                const sourceUrl = getValue(item, 'SourceUrl');
	                const botInfo = getBotInfo(item);
	                const decisionReason = getDecisionReason(item);
	                detailSubtitle.textContent = `${getHomeTeam(item)} vs ${getAwayTeam(item)} · ${getLeague(item)} · ${botInfo.label}`;
	                sourceLink.classList.toggle('d-none', !sourceUrl);
	                sourceLink.href = sourceUrl || '#';

                detailBody.innerHTML = `
                    <div class="row g-3">
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="small text-muted">Predicción total de ${escapeHtml(marketUnitLabel)}</div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(formatCompact(getValue(item, 'PredictedTotalCorners')))}</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="small text-muted">Distancia contra linea</div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(formatCompact(getValue(item, 'DistanceToLine')))}</div>
                        </div>
	                        <div class="col-md-4">
	                            <div class="small text-muted">Recommended side</div>
	                            <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(getValue(item, 'RecommendedSide') ?? '-')}</div>
	                        </div>
	                        <div class="col-md-4">
	                            <div class="small text-muted">Bot</div>
	                            <div><span class="bot-badge ${botInfo.badgeClass}">${escapeHtml(botInfo.label)}</span></div>
	                        </div>
	                        <div class="col-md-4">
	                            <div class="small text-muted">Automation version</div>
	                            <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(getValue(item, 'AutomationVersion') ?? 'Legacy')}</div>
	                        </div>
	                        <div class="col-md-4">
	                            <div class="small text-muted">Enlace resultado local</div>
	                            <div class="fw-semibold">Fixture ${escapeHtml(getValue(item, 'ApiFootballFixtureId') ?? '-')} · MatchHistory ${escapeHtml(getValue(item, 'MatchHistoryId') ?? '-')}</div>
	                        </div>
	                        <div class="col-md-4">
	                            <div class="small text-muted">Liquidación automática</div>
	                            <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(getValue(item, 'SettlementSource') ?? '-')} · ${escapeHtml(getValue(item, 'SettlementMatchStatus') ?? '-')}</div>
	                            <div class="small text-muted">${escapeHtml(getValue(item, 'SettlementReason') ?? getValue(item, 'LastSettlementCheckReason') ?? '-')}</div>
	                        </div>
	                        <div class="col-md-4">
	                            <div class="small text-muted">Neutral adjustment</div>
	                            <div>${hasNeutralAdjustment(item) ? '<span class="badge text-bg-info">Neutral</span>' : '<span class="text-muted">No</span>'}</div>
	                        </div>
	                        <div class="col-md-4">
	                            <div class="small text-muted">Direct / Home / Away</div>
	                            <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(formatCompact(getValue(item, 'PredTotalDirect')))} / ${escapeHtml(formatCompact(getValue(item, 'PredHomeCorners')))} / ${escapeHtml(formatCompact(getValue(item, 'PredAwayCorners')))}</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="small text-muted">Context total</div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(formatCompact(getValue(item, 'ContextTotalCorners')))}</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="small text-muted">Context difference</div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(formatCompact(getValue(item, 'ContextDifference')))}</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="small text-muted">Created</div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(formatDate(getValue(item, 'CreatedAtUtc')))}</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="small text-muted">Updated</div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(formatDate(getValue(item, 'UpdatedAtUtc')))}</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            <div class="small text-muted">Settled</div>
                            <div class="fw-semibold">${escapeHtml(formatDateOnly(getValue(item, 'SettledAtUtc')))}</div>
                        </div>
	                    </div>
	                    <hr />
	                    <h3 class="h6">Thresholds usados</h3>
	                    ${renderThresholds(decisionReason?.thresholds)}
	                    <hr />
	                    <h3 class="h6">Decision reason</h3>
                    ${renderReason(getValue(item, 'DecisionReason'))}
                `;

                detailModal.show();
            };

            filtersForm.addEventListener('submit', event => {
                event.preventDefault();
                loadSelections();
            });

            const syncFlatStakeStep = () => {
                const isClp = betCurrencySelect.value === 'CLP';
                flatBetStakeInput.step = isClp ? '1' : '0.01';
                flatBetStakeInput.min = isClp ? '1' : '0.01';

                const currentStake = number(flatBetStakeInput.value);
                if (isClp && currentStake !== null) {
                    flatBetStakeInput.value = String(Math.max(1, Math.round(currentStake)));
                    localStorage.setItem('bot-picks-flat-bet-stake', flatBetStakeInput.value);
                }
            };

            betCurrencySelect.addEventListener('change', () => {
                localStorage.setItem('bot-picks-bet-currency', betCurrencySelect.value);
                syncFlatStakeStep();
                render();
            });
            flatBetStakeInput.addEventListener('input', () => {
                localStorage.setItem('bot-picks-flat-bet-stake', flatBetStakeInput.value);
                render();
            });
            monthInput.addEventListener('change', () => {
                setMonthRange(parseMonthKey(monthInput.value));
            });
            previousMonthButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
                const selected = parseMonthKey(monthInput.value);
                setMonthRange(new Date(selected.getFullYear(), selected.getMonth() - 1, 1));
            });
            currentMonthButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
                const today = new Date();
                setMonthRange(new Date(today.getFullYear(), today.getMonth(), 1));
            });
            nextMonthButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
                const selected = parseMonthKey(monthInput.value);
                setMonthRange(new Date(selected.getFullYear(), selected.getMonth() + 1, 1));
            });
            botCHistoricalPendingButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
                const today = new Date();
                const formatDateInput = date =>
                    `${date.getFullYear()}-${String(date.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, '0')}-${String(date.getDate()).padStart(2, '0')}`;
                monthInput.value = '';
                dateFromInput.value = '2026-06-19';
                dateToInput.value = formatDateInput(today);
                statusSelect.value = 'Pending';
                tableBotKey = '';
                tableView = 'pending';
                tableBotSelect.value = '';
                localStorage.setItem(`${storagePrefix}-table-bot`, tableBotKey);
                localStorage.setItem(`${storagePrefix}-table-view`, tableView);
                filtersForm.requestSubmit();
            });
            dateFromInput.addEventListener('change', () => {
                if (!dateFromInput.value) {
                    return;
                }

                monthInput.value = dateFromInput.value.slice(0, 7);
                const selected = parseMonthKey(monthInput.value);
                const today = new Date();
                nextMonthButton.disabled =
                    selected.getFullYear() === today.getFullYear() &&
                    selected.getMonth() === today.getMonth();
            });
            monthlyHistoryBody.addEventListener('click', event => {
                const monthButton = event.target.closest('button[data-history-month]');
                if (monthButton) {
                    setMonthRange(parseMonthKey(monthButton.dataset.historyMonth));
                }
            });

		            refreshButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
                loadSelections();
                loadMonthlyHistory();
            });
            settleLocalButton?.addEventListener('click', settleLocalSelections);
            settlePendingButton?.addEventListener('click', settlePendingSelections);
		    let searchDebounce;
		    searchInput.addEventListener('input', () => {
                clearTimeout(searchDebounce);
                searchDebounce = setTimeout(() => render(true), 180);
            });
            strategyPlanSelect.addEventListener('change', () => render(true));
            tableBotSelect.addEventListener('change', () => {
                tableBotKey = tableBotSelect.value;
                localStorage.setItem(`${storagePrefix}-table-bot`, tableBotKey);
                render(true);
            });
            tableViewButtons.forEach(button => {
                button.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    tableView = button.dataset.tableView ?? 'all';
                    localStorage.setItem(`${storagePrefix}-table-view`, tableView);
                    render(true);
                });
            });
            leaguePerformanceSearch.addEventListener('input', () =>
                renderLeaguePerformance(leaguePerformanceItems));
            leaguePerformanceSort.addEventListener('change', () =>
                renderLeaguePerformance(leaguePerformanceItems));
            botTabButtons.forEach(button => {
                button.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    activeBotTab = button.dataset.botTab ?? '';
                    localStorage.setItem(`${storagePrefix}-active-tab`, activeBotTab);
                    render(true);
                });
            });
            comparisonCards.forEach(card => {
                const selectSummaryBot = () => {
                    activeBotTab = card.dataset.summaryBot ?? 'C';
                    localStorage.setItem(`${storagePrefix}-active-tab`, activeBotTab);
                    render(true);
                    document.getElementById('BotPicksSummary').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });
                };
                card.addEventListener('click', selectSummaryBot);
                card.addEventListener('keydown', event => {
                    if (event.key === 'Enter' || event.key === ' ') {
                        event.preventDefault();
                        selectSummaryBot();
                    }
                });
            });
		            initialBankrollInput.addEventListener('input', () => {
	                localStorage.setItem(`${storagePrefix}-initial-bankroll`, initialBankrollInput.value);
	                render();
	            });
		            tableBody.addEventListener('click', event => {
	                const resolveButton = event.target.closest('button[data-resolve-selection]');
	                if (resolveButton) {
	                    resolveSelection(resolveButton.dataset.resolveSelection);
	                    return;
	                }

	                const deleteButton = event.target.closest('button[data-delete-selection]');
	                if (deleteButton) {
	                    deleteSelection(deleteButton.dataset.deleteSelection);
	                    return;
	                }

	                const statusButton = event.target.closest('button[data-status-action]');
	                if (statusButton) {
	                    updateSelectionStatus(statusButton.dataset.selectionId, statusButton.dataset.statusAction);
	                    return;
	                }

	                const button = event.target.closest('button[data-detail-id]');
	                if (button) {
	                    openDetail(button.dataset.detailId);
	                }
	            });

	            tableBody.addEventListener('keydown', event => {
	                const input = event.target.closest('input[data-actual-result]');
	                if (input && event.key === 'Enter') {
	                    event.preventDefault();
	                    resolveSelection(input.dataset.actualResult);
	                }
	            });

            paginationButtons.addEventListener('click', event => {
                const pageButton = event.target.closest('button[data-page]');
                if (!pageButton || pageButton.disabled) {
                    return;
                }

                const nextPage = Number(pageButton.dataset.page);
                if (!Number.isInteger(nextPage) || nextPage < 1) {
                    return;
                }

                currentPage = nextPage;
                renderRows();
                document.getElementById('BotPicksTableTitle').scrollIntoView({
                    behavior: 'smooth',
                    block: 'start'
                });
            });

            document.querySelectorAll('[data-sort]').forEach(button => {
                button.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    const nextField = button.dataset.sort;
                    if (sortField === nextField) {
                        sortDirection = sortDirection === 'asc' ? 'desc' : 'asc';
                    } else {
                        sortField = nextField;
                        sortDirection = nextField === 'matchDate' ? 'asc' : 'desc';
                    }

                    render(true);
                });
            });

            syncFlatStakeStep();
            const initialMonth = parseMonthKey(monthInput.value);
            const today = new Date();
            nextMonthButton.disabled =
                initialMonth.getFullYear() === today.getFullYear() &&
                initialMonth.getMonth() === today.getMonth();
            loadSelections();
            loadMonthlyHistory();
        })();
    </script>
}
